  <!-- ===================== FAQ ===================== -->
  <section class="section" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <header class="section-head">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">Good to know</p>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="faq-title">Frequently asked questions.</h2>
      </header>

      <div class="faq">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">Do I need a referral to start?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>No. You can begin treatment without a referral. Some insurance plans require one for coverage, so we verify yours before your first visit. <span class="cue">(Confirm the no-referral policy with Dr. Iftikhar.)</span></p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">How long is each appointment?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Plan on 45-60 minutes, one-on-one with your therapist. You won't be passed between aides or left on a machine.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">What should I wear?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Comfortable, loose-fitting clothes you can move in. Shorts for knee or leg issues, a tank top for shoulder or neck work.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">What insurance do you take?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Most major commercial plans, plus Medicare, No-Fault, and Workers' Comp. Don't see yours? Call <a href="tel:+15167896322">(516) 789-6322</a> and we'll verify it for you.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
